18
00:00:37,676 --> 00:00:40,082
The Anger Monster Comes Out!

19
00:00:40,833 --> 00:00:44,417
After lunch, May and Little Deer were playing with their toys.

20
00:00:44,750 --> 00:00:47,417
Ha! The super track is ready!

21
00:00:47,917 --> 00:00:49,083
Whoosh!

22
00:00:49,083 --> 00:00:50,083
Hahaha!

23
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:54,833
Vroom-vroom!

24
00:00:57,250 --> 00:00:57,500
Little Deer

25
00:01:00,500 --> 00:01:01,583
Vroom-vroom!

26
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:05,167
Little Deer! You broke my track!

27
00:01:09,583 --> 00:01:11,333
You shouldn’t take other people’s things!

28
00:01:14,583 --> 00:01:15,667
Waaah!

29
00:01:15,667 --> 00:01:17,083
Vroom-vroom!

30
00:01:20,917 --> 00:01:22,833
May, what’s wrong?

31
00:01:22,833 --> 00:01:25,167
Mom, Little Deer broke my track!

32
00:01:26,500 --> 00:01:29,667
May, your little brother is still young. He doesn’t know any better.

33
00:01:29,667 --> 00:01:31,333
You should be more patient with him.

34
00:01:31,333 --> 00:01:33,000
You shouldn’t be so mean to your little brother.

35
00:01:33,750 --> 00:01:35,333
Come on, make up with him.

36
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:41,000
No! Little Deer broke my track first!

37
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:43,500
It was Little Deer’s fault! You’re the worst, Mom!

38
00:01:43,667 --> 00:01:45,167
I don’t want to play with you anymore!

39
00:01:46,833 --> 00:01:48,833
May stormed off in a huff.

40
00:01:58,500 --> 00:01:58,917
Hehe!

41
00:01:59,500 --> 00:02:01,833
Hello, May! I’m the Anger Monster.

42
00:02:02,250 --> 00:02:04,750
Are you feeling really, really angry?

43
00:02:04,750 --> 00:02:07,667
Like a volcano that’s about to erupt!

44
00:02:09,167 --> 00:02:11,917
Come on! Let’s get really mad!

45
00:02:11,917 --> 00:02:15,083
Let’s stomp our feet!

46
00:02:15,083 --> 00:02:18,917
Let’s pound the pillows!

47
00:02:19,083 --> 00:02:21,250
Now let’s all scream!

48
00:02:21,417 --> 00:02:22,417
Waaah!

49
00:02:22,750 --> 00:02:23,083
Roar!

50
00:02:29,333 --> 00:02:30,250
Haaah!

51
00:02:38,917 --> 00:02:40,917
Draw, draw!

52
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:43,000
Let’s get angry together!

53
00:02:43,057 --> 00:02:45,167
Draw, draw!

54
00:02:47,583 --> 00:02:51,167
Draw, draw! Make the Anger Monster even stronger!

55
00:03:00,250 --> 00:03:03,333
May noticed her angry face had turned bright red.

56
00:03:03,333 --> 00:03:04,667
It wasn’t cute at all.

57
00:03:07,250 --> 00:03:08,917
Look what you made me do!

58
00:03:08,917 --> 00:03:10,500
I hate you messing up my room!

59
00:03:11,250 --> 00:03:13,667
The angrier you get, the stronger I become!

60
00:03:13,667 --> 00:03:16,167
Look how big I’ve gotten!

61
00:03:16,333 --> 00:03:20,417
We’re becoming more and more alike. Isn’t that great?

62
00:03:20,833 --> 00:03:22,500
I don’t want to be like you!

63
00:03:22,500 --> 00:03:25,167
I don’t like myself! I’m so angry!

64
00:03:25,167 --> 00:03:26,667
Haha!

65
00:03:27,917 --> 00:03:28,583
May!

66
00:03:29,250 --> 00:03:30,000
May!

67
00:03:30,417 --> 00:03:32,333
Oh no! I’ve been spotted!

68
00:03:33,250 --> 00:03:36,167
May, Mom has made some delicious snacks.

69
00:03:36,167 --> 00:03:37,167
Come and have some!

70
00:03:38,083 --> 00:03:38,833
I don’t want any!

71
00:03:39,583 --> 00:03:42,250
I’m sorry. I shouldn’t have scolded you right away.

72
00:03:42,583 --> 00:03:45,167
It’s okay to have difficult feelings.

73
00:03:45,167 --> 00:03:46,167
Take a little time to calm down.

74
00:03:46,500 --> 00:03:48,083
Remember to take a deep breath.

75
00:03:48,083 --> 00:03:50,250
When you’re not angry anymore, come out and have a snack.

76
00:03:50,583 --> 00:03:52,250
Don’t let the Anger Monster win!

77
00:04:03,000 --> 00:04:05,750
I-I need to calm down. Calm down…

78
00:04:06,833 --> 00:04:09,833
Little Calm Angel, please come out and help me!

79
00:04:15,417 --> 00:04:17,333
That’s right. I need to take deep breaths.

80
00:04:22,083 --> 00:04:25,083
May, why are you taking deep breaths?

81
00:04:25,167 --> 00:04:27,750
Y-you’re supposed to stay angry!

82
00:04:28,917 --> 00:04:30,500
I-I’ll tidy everything up and put it back where it belongs.

83
00:04:30,833 --> 00:04:31,833
I-I’ll tidy everything up and put it back where it belongs.

84
00:04:32,000 --> 00:04:32,583
You have to stay angry!

85
00:04:33,083 --> 00:04:34,250
You have to stay angry!

86
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:36,333
I-I’ll help you…

87
00:04:36,750 --> 00:04:39,167
You have to keep being angry!

88
00:04:39,667 --> 00:04:40,667
Little Angel!

89
00:04:41,250 --> 00:04:44,417
Let’s give the Anger Monster a cute makeover!

90
00:04:54,833 --> 00:04:59,083
Oh! If you stop being angry, I’ll lose all my power!

91
00:05:00,417 --> 00:05:02,250
I-I’ve turned into a tiny baby!

92
00:05:03,500 --> 00:05:06,250
Hahaha! How cute!

93
00:05:07,500 --> 00:05:09,833
Oh dear. Looks like you’re not angry anymore.

94
00:05:09,833 --> 00:05:12,083
No one to make a mess with. I’m so bored.

95
00:05:14,500 --> 00:05:15,917
Little Angel, thank you!

96
00:05:19,917 --> 00:05:21,250
The Anger Monster is gone!

97
00:05:25,000 --> 00:05:26,750
May, are you feeling better?

98
00:05:26,750 --> 00:05:27,917
Come have some jelly!

99
00:05:28,250 --> 00:05:31,167
Mom! I-I defeated the Anger Monster!

100
00:05:31,583 --> 00:05:34,500
I-I’m sorry. I shouldn’t have been so mean to my little brother.

101
00:05:34,500 --> 00:05:35,500
It’s all right now.

102
00:05:35,583 --> 00:05:38,083
Mom was just worried about you. I wasn’t angry.

103
00:05:38,333 --> 00:05:40,417
Little Deer has something to say to you, too.

104
00:05:42,667 --> 00:05:44,833
Big sis… s-sorry.

105
00:05:45,167 --> 00:05:46,417
Vroom-vroom!

106
00:05:46,417 --> 00:05:49,167
I’m not angry anymore. I love you both so much!

107
00:05:49,167 --> 00:05:50,333
Hug!

108
00:05:50,333 --> 00:05:56,417
Hahahahaha!
